---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Looks"
  description="How many times people opened pages on The Soul Searchers."
  robots="noindex, nofollow"
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="site-shell looks">
      <p class="eyebrow">Open counts</p>
      <h1 class="section-title">Looks</h1>
      <p class="section-lead">
        Private for you. How many times someone opened a page, day by day and week by week.
        No names. Counts start after this Worker is live.
      </p>

      <div class="cards">
        <article class="card">
          <p class="card-label">Today</p>
          <p class="card-num" data-looks="today">—</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <p class="card-label">Last 7 days</p>
          <p class="card-num" data-looks="week">—</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <p class="card-label">This year</p>
          <p class="card-num" data-looks="year">—</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <p class="card-label">All time</p>
          <p class="card-num" data-looks="total">—</p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <h2 class="pages-title">Last 14 days</h2>
      <p class="note">Berlin days. Tallest bar is the busiest day in this window.</p>
      <ol class="looks-bars" data-looks-days>
        <li class="empty">Day bars show once people have opened the site.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2 class="pages-title">Last 8 weeks</h2>
      <p class="note">Each bar is seven days. Handy for “this week vs last week”.</p>
      <ol class="looks-bars" data-looks-weeks>
        <li class="empty">Week bars show once people have opened the site.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2 class="pages-title">All the years</h2>
      <ol class="pages" data-looks-years>
        <li class="empty">Years show once people have opened the site.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2 class="pages-title">Pages people opened</h2>
      <ol class="pages" data-looks-pages>
        <li class="empty">Open Home, Now, or a ride, then refresh this page.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2 class="pages-title">Where they opened from</h2>
      <ol class="pages" data-looks-countries>
        <li class="empty">Country shows after someone opens a page.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2 class="pages-title">What sent them</h2>
      <p class="note">
        Tap a name to open that site (Instagram, Facebook, and so on). Browsers often hide the exact
        post, so you get the network, not the single link.
      </p>
      <ol class="pages" data-looks-from>
        <li class="empty">The site that sent them shows after someone opens a page.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .looks {
    max-width: 40rem;
  }

  .cards {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin: 1.75rem 0 2.25rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .cards {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .cards {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .card {
    padding: 1.1rem 1.15rem 1.2rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(215, 224, 232, 0.1);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    background: rgba(18, 26, 34, 0.55);
  }

  .card-label {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--amber);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .card-num {
    margin: 0.45rem 0 0;
    color: var(--paper);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .looks-bars {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.15rem;
    list-style: none;
    border: 1px solid rgba(215, 224, 232, 0.1);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    background: rgba(18, 26, 34, 0.55);
  }

  .looks-bar {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3.6rem 1fr 2.4rem;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }

  .looks-bars[data-looks-weeks] .looks-bar {
    grid-template-columns: 7.5rem 1fr 2.4rem;
  }

  .looks-bar-label {
    color: rgba(215, 224, 232, 0.78);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .looks-bar-track {
    display: block;
    height: 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(215, 224, 232, 0.1);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .looks-bar-fill {
    display: block;
    height: 100%;
    width: var(--looks-bar, 0%);
    border-radius: inherit;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--amber-hot), var(--amber));
  }

  .looks-bar-num {
    text-align: right;
    color: var(--amber-hot);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .looks-bars .empty {
    color: rgba(215, 224, 232, 0.68);
  }
</style>
